  "prediction_postprocess": "adsb-surface-residual-v12-v5",
  "prior_evidence": "Declared after v12 (official 246.4831, 3rd) and after adsb_v12_v4 selected blend_all_30 with the LightGBM learner alone (-0.35% / -0.26% / -1.40% versus v12; exported as v13, not uploaded). Before this declaration, descriptive full-month blends of the recorded v12 development predictions with the learners' out-of-sample fold predictions on non-LIRF rows gave, versus v12: LightGBM at w=0.3/0.4/0.5: -0.35/-0.35/-0.28% (Jan), -0.26/-0.19/-0.05% (Jul), -1.40/-1.59/-1.64% (Nov); CatBoost: -0.45/-0.49/-0.46%, -0.55/-0.59/-0.56%, -1.51/-1.73/-1.81%; their mean: -0.46/-0.52/-0.54%, -0.50/-0.55/-0.56%, -1.59/-1.90/-2.10%. The two learners correlate at 0.982 on Nov. The candidates therefore blend the mean of the two label learners at w = 0.3, 0.4, 0.5 and 0.6 on all non-LIRF rows, and at 0.5 on matched rows only; the v12 residual model is refitted inside the run exactly as in v12_v2/v12_v4. Expected size on the ranking: 0.8-2%.",
